      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56276386583117824
    m_Localized: 'You can move to the room in that direction by clicking the arrow
      shown nearby.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56314693711003648
    m_Localized: 'Once battle begins, you cannot flee you must defeat all enemies
      by utilizing the skills listed below.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56493937409884160
    m_Localized: Please note that each skill has specific usable positions and attack
      ranges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56494019131703296
    m_Localized: 'As the number of party members increases, you will need to move
      them to positions from which they can attack.

      Press this button and
      then select a location to move a unit.

      Please note that each unit has
      its own movement limitations.

'
